{"name":"Assur","status":"ok","title":"Assur","pageId":36402,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Assur</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Small city</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Humans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humans\">Humans</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halflings</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin\" title=\"Goblin\">Goblins</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p118-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5,000<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p118-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Assur</b> was a small port city in <a href=\"/wiki/Durpar\" title=\"Durpar\">Durpar</a>.  The city was destroyed by <a href=\"/wiki/Giants\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Giants\">giants</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/Beastlands\" title=\"Beastlands\">Beastlands</a> but was rebuilt as a fortress city with a large garrison.  The city had a deep harbor and a large market.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p118-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Assur?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCG-p118-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bruce_R._Cordell\" title=\"Bruce R. Cordell\">Bruce R. Cordell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Sims\" title=\"Chris Sims\">Chris Sims</a>&#160;(August 2008). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide\">Forgotten Realms Camp